---
description: Preserve Kundexa's canonical domain and migration model
alwaysApply: true
---

- Add forward-only migrations; do not rewrite delivered migrations.
- `customers` is the canonical CRM record. Lists, calls, callbacks, notes and orders stay in their dedicated canonical tables.
- Platform lists are supply/lineage; tenant `customer_lists` are operational queues.
- Use atomic RPCs plus transactional outbox for multi-table/provider workflows.
- Preserve idempotency, audit, claims, NIX/contact policy, retention and immutable contract evidence.
- Keep API scopes centralized in `src/lib/permissions.ts`.
- Do not hand-edit generated Supabase types; regenerate from a linked database.
- Target Node 22.x and npm 10.9.2.
